姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001161","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p061","chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p061","text":"二十八年，初，靈公取魯女，生子光，以為太子。仲姬，戎姬。戎姬嬖，仲姬生子牙，屬之戎姬。戎姬請以為太子，公許之。仲姬曰：「不可。光之立，列於諸侯矣，今無故廢之，君必悔之。」公曰：「在我耳。」遂東太子光，使高厚傅牙為太子。靈公疾，崔杼迎故太子光而立之，是為莊公。莊公殺戎姬。五月壬辰，靈公卒，莊公即位，執太子牙於句竇之丘，殺之。八月，崔杼殺高厚。晉聞齊亂，伐齊，至高唐。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m061-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001156","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m061-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"魯女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001159","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m061-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"子光","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000264","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m061-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"太子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、族稱或未定指代；齊秉意茲等疑讀待版本校勘，不補熟知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m061-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"仲姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001160","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m061-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"戎姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001161","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m061-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"戎姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001161","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m061-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"仲姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001160","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m061-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"子牙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001162","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m061-0040","start":40,"end":42,"sur